LeVeque reversing-vortex level set on a wavelet-adaptive MRAG grid.

Compile
    make

Run (writes phi.NNNN.xdmf2 + .raw)
    make run

Iso-line postprocessing (amriso)
    python3 -m pip install --user git+https://github.com/cselab/amriso
    ./post.py phi.xdmf2 --out iso

View
    paraview phi.xdmf2 iso.xdmf2
